<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: Cricket-West Indies v India scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-West Indies v India scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day of the second test between West Indies and India at the Queen's Park Oval on Monday:</p>
<p>West Indies first innings 296 (R.Holder 91; A.Kumble 5-104)</p>
<p>India first innings (overnight 367-3)</p>
<p> V.V.Laxman lbw b Ambrose		   0</p>
<p> N.Sidhu b Ambrose			  201</p>
<p> R.Dravid b Ambrose			  57</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar run out			 88</p>
<p> S.Ganguly c Chanderpaul b Rose	   6</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin b Ambrose		     1</p>
<p> N.Mongia b Dillon			   17</p>
