<p> Total					  436</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-0 2-171 3-345 4-370 5-371 6-382 7-401 8-420 9-420</p>
<p>Bowling: Ambrose 41.4-10-87-5 (nb1), Walsh 36-11-71-0 (nb2), Rose 35-6-93-1 (nb4), Dillon 35-6-92-3 (nb1), Hooper 28-9-53-0, Chanderpaul 8-1-20-0</p>
